    <string name="odmr_info_title">About</string>
    <string name="odmr_info_text">This tab drives the openUC2 qBOX ODMR board over USB with its serial protocol; the same measurements are in the browser at youseetoo.github.io/odmr and on the board\'s own WiFi pages (http://192.168.4.1). Files are saved to Download/UC2 ODMR and can be shared from the message that follows.</string>
    <string name="odmr_principle_title">ODMR principle</string>
    <string name="odmr_principle_text">NV centres in diamond show spin-dependent fluorescence. Microwaves at the resonance frequency (~2.87 GHz) lower the fluorescence measurably. External magnetic fields shift the resonance through the Zeeman effect, which is the basis of the magnetic field measurement.</string>
    <string name="odmr_safety">⚠ Never look into the laser. Careful with magnets near implants and electronics.</string>
    <string name="odmr_docs">Open the ODMR tutorial</string>
    <string name="odmr_cd_lattice">NV centre in the diamond lattice</string>

